---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Hebei Wire Mesh Factory: Beyond Anping";
const description = "Hebei Province's wire mesh industry extends beyond Anping County. Explore regional specializations, logistics advantages, and how to evaluate Hebei manufacturers.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Hebei Wire Mesh: Regional Overview</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl">
        While Anping County dominates Hebei's wire mesh production, other regions offer
        distinct advantages. Understanding the full landscape helps you source strategically.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-amber-500">Home</a> / Hebei Wire Mesh
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- Hebei Context -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Hebei's Wire Mesh Industry</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Hebei Province surrounds Beijing and Tianjin, giving it exceptional logistics access
        to China's capital region and major ports. The province's industrial base includes
        steel production, metal processing, and wire mesh manufacturing—creating natural
        vertical integration.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Key characteristics of Hebei wire mesh manufacturing:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>Raw material access</strong> — Proximity to major steel producers reduces wire costs</li>
        <li><strong>Port logistics</strong> — Tianjin Port (Xingang) handles significant wire mesh exports</li>
        <li><strong>Industrial clustering</strong> — Supporting industries (galvanizing, PVC coating, packaging) co-located</li>
        <li><strong>Cost structure</strong> — Lower land and labor costs than coastal regions</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Regional Specializations -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Regional Specializations</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Different areas of Hebei have developed distinct wire mesh specializations:
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-slate-100">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Region</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Specialization</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Anping County</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">All wire mesh types</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Industry center, widest product range</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Hengshui Area</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Rubber-coated mesh, specialty products</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Emerging cluster, some innovation focus</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Shijiazhuang</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Distribution, trading companies</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Provincial capital, logistics hub</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Tianjin Corridor</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Export processing, port logistics</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Convenient for export-focused orders</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hebei vs Other Regions -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Hebei vs. Other Manufacturing Regions</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        How does Hebei compare to other Chinese wire mesh manufacturing regions?
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-slate-100">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Region</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Strengths</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Considerations</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Hebei (Anping)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Complete supply chain, competitive pricing, product variety</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Quality varies widely; due diligence essential</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Jiangsu (Nantong)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Higher precision mesh, technical textiles</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Higher prices, smaller scale for standard products</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Guangdong</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Export experience, proximity to Hong Kong logistics</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Higher costs, less specialization in wire mesh</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-slate-900">Zhejiang</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">General metal products, trading networks</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-slate-700">Less wire mesh specialization</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Evaluating Hebei Factories -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Evaluating Hebei Wire Mesh Factories</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Regardless of specific location, these factors help distinguish reliable Hebei manufacturers:
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Production Equipment</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Modern weaving machines (Swiss or German looms for precision mesh),
            consistent wire drawing capability, in-house galvanizing lines.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Quality Systems</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            ISO 9001 certification is common among export-oriented factories.
            Ask for quality manuals and recent third-party audit reports.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Export Track Record</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Request references from buyers in your region. Established exporters
            should provide contactable references.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Technical Capability</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Can they produce to international standards (ASTM, DIN, JIS)?
            Do they understand your application's requirements?
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Logistics -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Logistics from Hebei</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Hebei's location offers several shipping options:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>Tianjin Port (Xingang)</strong> — Primary export gateway, ~2-3 hours from Anping</li>
        <li><strong>Qingdao Port</strong> — Alternative for shipments to South America and Africa</li>
        <li><strong>Shanghai Port</strong> — Used for some consolidated shipments</li>
        <li><strong>Rail options</strong> — China-Europe rail for landlocked destinations</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        Most factories handle export documentation, but clarify responsibilities
        (EXW, FOB, CIF terms) before ordering. Our <a href="/sourcing-guide/" class="text-amber-600 hover:underline">sourcing guide</a> covers
        Incoterms in detail.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Pages -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Continue Exploring</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/anping-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-slate-200 rounded hover:border-amber-500 transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Anping Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Deep dive into the industry's center</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/sourcing-guide/" class="block p-4 border border-slate-200 rounded hover:border-amber-500 transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Sourcing Guide</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Step-by-step procurement process</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/procurement-process/" class="block p-4 border border-slate-200 rounded hover:border-amber-500 transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Procurement Process</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">RFQ to delivery workflow</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/factory-directory/" class="block p-4 border border-slate-200 rounded hover:border-amber-500 transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Factory Directory</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Browse verified manufacturers</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Sourcing from Hebei?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">Send your requirements. We'll help you find the right manufacturer.</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-900 font-semibold px-6 py-2 rounded transition">
        Send Inquiry
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
